; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - carry + trend (entry mode 7, chapters 82-83). No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; Each week: for 17 pairs, compute the annual swap from the account's own swap values; keep pairs where the swap-earning side
; agrees with the 60-day price direction and volatility has not suddenly doubled; hold the top 5 by carry / volatility,
; sized so the whole portfolio targets 10% annual volatility (gross at most 5x equity, margin at most 90%).
; Attach to a USDJPY H1 (or M5) chart.
InpEntryMode=7
InpSymbols=USDJPY,EURUSD,EURJPY,GBPJPY,AUDJPY,GBPUSD,AUDCAD,AUDNZD,AUDUSD,CADJPY,CHFJPY,EURGBP,NZDCAD,NZDJPY,NZDUSD,USDCAD,USDCHF
InpCtTrendDays=60
InpCtMinCarry=1.0
InpCtTopK=5
InpCtCrashMul=2.0
InpCtVolTarget=10.0
InpCtMaxLev=5.0
InpCtRebalanceDays=7
InpCtHour=3
InpCtBand=0.25
InpCtSLVolMul=6.0
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpSplitOrders=true
InpAsyncOrders=false
